--- !u!114 &114221464695838480
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1476783233174730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 305
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 那尸傀确实是坚硬无比，硬抗刚才那一连串攻击之后虽然行动稍有迟缓，但看起来也只是受了点皮肉伤而已。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114704439000144027}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114280467897619923
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1476783233174730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 313
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你全力击退那尸傀后，运起遁术便向宗门方向离去。那尸傀似乎是不想落入被数名元婴围攻的惨况，倒也不追你，化作幻影向另一个地方离开了。
