  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 327
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 这甬道比之前神秘洞府入口的石道要长上一些，不同的是，除了黑暗以外再无其他装点。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114704439000144027}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114146119214117045
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1476783233174730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 308
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 在知道与自己战斗的是尸傀后，你一直在试图寻找藏在背后的傀儡师。虽然战斗时他依旧可以很好的掩盖自身的气息，但终究还是要用神识操控这具尸傀，也就给了你可乘之机。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114704439000144027}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114364957820292512
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1476783233174730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 306
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 可你不会等他调整状态，只听“轰”的一声，那尸傀随着巨响分裂开来。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 0
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114704439000144027}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114748976905709028
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1476783233174730}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
